      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/dspv/caprock\n\n### Category\n\nGo\n\n### Project Title\n\nSee what your Claude Code is actually doing\n\n### Project Description\n\nOpen-source local dashboard for Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode and Gemini CLI: live activity, cost per repo, loop alerts, searchable history. No telemetry.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- One Go binary (single static binary with the React dashboard embedded, SQLite storage) that runs on macOS, Linux and Windows.\n- Shows live activity per session, token cost per repository and per model at API list prices, and the 5-hour and weekly plan-limit windows.\n- Alerts when a session repeats the same tool call in a loop.\n- Everything the agent wrote is searchable across sessions, and history is kept after Claude Code's 30-day transcript cleanup.\n- Loopback only, no account, no telemetry. Apache-2.0.\n\n### Example Code\n\n```bash\n# macOS / Linux\nbrew install dspv/tap/caprock\n\n# Windows\nscoop bucket add dspv https://github.com/dspv/scoop-bucket\nscoop install caprock\n\n# Any OS with Go\ngo install github.com/dspv/caprock/cmd/caprock@latest\n\ncaprock up   # opens http://localhost:22776\n```\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\n![Live activity and cost per repo](https://caprock.dev/shots/shot-now.png)\n\nDisclosure: I'm the author.\n",
